# Lifecycle event maker action type: Creation, Amendment, Early Termination, Cancellation, etc
@When "^perform the Partial Novation Remaining event on the '([^']*)' trade from portal page$"
    When opens lifecycle action 'partial novation remaining' for current trade
    And fills Partial Novation Remaining event form with required values for '$1' product type
    And confirms Partial Novation Remaining event and stores new trade id

@When "^perform the Partial Novation Remaining event on the '([^']*)' trade from detail page$"
    When navigate to trade details for stored trade 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade detail clicks more actions button
    And page trade detail clicks partial novation remaining button
    And fills Partial Novation Remaining event form with required values for '$1' product type
    And confirms Partial Novation Remaining event and stores new trade id

@When "^fills Partial Novation Remaining event form with required values for '([^']*)' product type$"
    When component dynamic action types remaining notional from stored variable 'remainingNotional'
    And component dynamic action equation line contains stored variable 'equationLineValue.$1'
    And component dynamic action selects counterparty from stored variable 'newCptyName'
    And confirm dynamic action form using configured partial risk engine mode for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'

@When "^confirms Partial Novation Remaining event and stores new trade id$"
    When component trade change confirmation dialog is visible
    And confirm lifecycle event trade change and capture response as 'partialNovationRemainingResponse'
    And store e2e response field 'data.results[0].childTradeIds[0]' from stored variable 'partialNovationRemainingResponse' as 'newTradeId'

@Then "^trade is partially novated with remaining notional retained and counterparty transferred for '([^']*)'$"
    Then trade details show 'LIVE' status with correct notional 'remainingNotional' and counterparty 'basic.counterpartyName' for trade 'createdTradeId'
    When navigate to trade details for stored trade 'newTradeId'
    Then trade details show 'LIVE' status with correct notional 'newNotional.$1' and counterparty 'newCptyName' for trade 'newTradeId'

@Then "^trade details show '([^']*)' status with correct notional '([^']*)' and counterparty '([^']*)' for trade '([^']*)'$"
    When navigate to trade details for stored trade '$4'
    Then page trade detail header card contains from stored variable '$4'
    And page trade detail status badge shows '$1'
    And page trade detail basic info notional amount field shows value from stored variable '$2'
    And page trade detail counterparty field shows value from stored variable '$3'

@Then "^the partial novation remaining is completed successfully$"
    Then assert toast notification with type 'success' and message 'PartialNovationRemaining completed successfully'
